</string-name>. <article-title>Commentary on &#x0201c;Elective upper&#x02010;neck versus whole&#x02010;neck irradiation of the uninvolved neck in patients with nasopharyngeal carcinoma: an open&#x02010;label, non&#x02010;inferiority, multicentre, randomised phase 3 trial</article-title>&#x0201d;. <source>Chin Clin Oncol</source>. <year>2022</year>;<volume>11</volume>(<issue>5</issue>):<fpage>35</fpage>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">36096750</pub-id>
